SUMMARY:Wild Roots
DESCRIPTION:Wild Roots blends banjo\, guitar\, flute\, bodhrán\, and deep harmony to create music that transports listeners to an evening around the campfire or an intimate gathering with friends in a meadow. Led by Julia Peach and Olivia Moore\, the two women weave together their instruments and ideas into love songs for the mystic. Their way of wandering the world will have you grooving and floating across the dance floor. Based in Asheville\, NC much of their music is devoted to the rhythms of nature\, and the power of connection. \n  \nFounded in 2005\, Pisgah is known for producing some of the most sought after craft ales in Western North Carolina. Pisgah Brewing Company currently operates the new indoor taproom with live music several days a week\, plus our outdoor music venue in the summer and fall months with live music frequently on WNC’s premier outdoor music venue\, the Pisgah Brewing Outdoor Stage. Bric’s Dip & Roll will be open Wednesday-Sunday from 4-10pm at the taproom! Be sure to come hungry\, thirsty and ready rock! Check out our upcoming schedule at pisgahbrewing.com/events
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/wild-roots/
LOCATION:Pisgah Brewing Company Black Mountain\, 2948 US-70\, Black Mountain\, NC\, 28711
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Black Mountain,Live Music
