SUMMARY:Jazz Showcase & Jam
DESCRIPTION:Thursdays\, 7 PM – 10 PM: An evening of smooth sounds and great vibes at Shamrock Irons with live Jazz performances followed by an Open Jam Session!\n\n\nJoin us at Shamrock Irons Irish Pub for a night of smooth jazz and one of Asheville’s best midweek hangs.\nOur weekly Jazz Showcase\, curated by Asheville musician Steven Alvarez\, brings together some of the area’s most talented players for an intimate live set to kick off the night.\nThen it opens up.\nThe second half of the evening turns into a live open jam session — where musicians jump in\, the energy builds\, and anything can happen.\nWhether you’re a jazz head\, a player\, or just looking for a laid-back night with great music\, this is the spot.\nNO COVER CHARGE\n\n\n\n\nShamrock Irons Irish Pub – Asheville’s newest Irish Pub experience! We’re bringing back the fun with a fresh look\, perfect pours\, and the best live music downtown. Whether you’re a regular or a first-timer\, there’s always room for one more at Shamrock Irons. shamrockirons.com
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/jazz-showcase-jam-curated-by-steven-alvarez-2/2026-07-16/
LOCATION:Shamrock Irons Irish Pub\, 4 College St\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music,Open MIc/Jam
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/JAZZ-SHOWCASE-2026-e1780752104199.png
GEO:35.9844236;-80.0221361
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Shamrock Irons Irish Pub 4 College St Asheville NC 28801 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=4 College St:geo:-80.0221361,35.9844236
END:VEVENT
